    "title": "MICROSERVICE-batchinsertion-List Ecommerce Cart Taxs-v1-spec",
    "description": "The Ecommerce Cart Tax Retrieval API provides merchants with access to tax information applicable to items in the shopping cart. By querying this endpoint, users can efficiently retrieve the relevant tax rates based on the items and their respective locations. This is particularly useful for e-commerce platforms and online retailers looking to ensure accurate tax calculations during the checkout process. Typical consumers of this API include developers integrating taxation functionalities into shopping carts and businesses seeking compliance with regional tax laws.",
